<newsitem itemid="91532" id="root" date="1996-10-02" xml:lang="en">
<title>FRANCE: Bongrain H1 net profit drops.</title>
<headline>Bongrain H1 net profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net for group				129.5  vs	   164.6</p>
<p>    Net global				   148.1  vs	   184.0</p>
<p>    Operating				    250.3  vs	   312.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax					237.1  vs	   276.5</p>
<p>    Financial charges			   -2.6  vs	   -37.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				     5,055  vs	   4,936</p>
<p>NOTE - Bongrain released the results in a statement, saying the drop in profit was due to a difficult economic context generally and in the dairy sector in particular.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
